      *>--- conformance-case
      *> id: 1985-GR-XIII_3_12_1-p1
      *> rules: [1985-GR-XIII.3.12.1-p1, 1985-GR-XIII.3.14.1-p1]
      *> accept: [85]
      *> source-format: fixed
      *> portable: unverified
      *>---
      *> §1985:XIII.3.12.1 p1; §1985:XIII.3.14.1 p1 (THE DATA-NAME
      *> CLAUSE). An output test: the program must translate and run at
      *> 85 and DISPLAY exactly the lines its .out holds, the outcome
      *> the rule requires. Placed from written and run by the PB5453
      *> reader of lineage-reads-1985/s-18.json by
      *> scripts/spec/place_witnesses.py (kb/Work PB4995).
      * 1985 XIII.3.12.1: a data-name names the item described (a
      * detail GENERATEd by name, a sum counter read by name).
      * 1985 XIII.3.14.1: the level-number places an item in the
      * report group's hierarchy (10 items under each 05 LINE).
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. P03.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT PRT-FILE ASSIGN TO PRINTER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  PRT-FILE
           REPORT IS RPT.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-AMT PIC 99.
       01  WS-LC PIC 99.
       01  WS-TOT PIC 999.
       REPORT SECTION.
       RD  RPT
           CONTROL IS FINAL.
       01  DETAIL-LINE TYPE IS DETAIL.
           05  LINE NUMBER IS PLUS 1.
               10  COLUMN 1 PIC X(3) VALUE "AMT".
               10  COLUMN 5 PIC 99 SOURCE WS-AMT.
           05  LINE NUMBER IS PLUS 1.
               10  COLUMN 1 PIC X(3) VALUE "---".
       01  TYPE IS CONTROL FOOTING FINAL.
           05  LINE NUMBER IS PLUS 1.
               10  COLUMN 1 PIC X(3) VALUE "TOT".
               10  TOTAL-AMT COLUMN 5 PIC 999 SUM WS-AMT.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           OPEN OUTPUT PRT-FILE.
           INITIATE RPT.
           MOVE 12 TO WS-AMT.
           GENERATE DETAIL-LINE.
           MOVE LINE-COUNTER TO WS-LC.
           DISPLAY "LC " WS-LC.
           MOVE 30 TO WS-AMT.
           GENERATE DETAIL-LINE.
           MOVE LINE-COUNTER TO WS-LC.
           DISPLAY "LC " WS-LC.
           MOVE TOTAL-AMT TO WS-TOT.
           DISPLAY "TOTAL-AMT " WS-TOT.
           TERMINATE RPT.
           CLOSE PRT-FILE.
           STOP RUN.
